{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-heb-9-1","title":"Hebrews 9:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The description of the rites and bloody sacrifices of the law; 11 which are far inferior to the dignity and perfection of the blood and sacrifice of Christ.</p>\n<p>the first. 8:7,13 had. 10; Le 18:3,4,30; 22:9; Nu 9:12; Eze 43:11; Lu 1:6 ordinances. or, ceremonies. and. 10,11; 8:2; Ex 25:8; Col 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-2","title":"Hebrews 9:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>a tabernacle. Ex 26:1-30; 29:1,35; 36:8-38; 39:32-34; 40:2,18-20 the first. Ex 25:23-40; 26:35; 37:10-24; 39:36-38; 40:4,22-24 the table. Ex 40:4; Le 24:5,6 the shewbread. Ex 25:23,30 the sanctuary. or, holy. Ex 26:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-3","title":"Hebrews 9:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the second. 6:19; 10:20; Ex 26:31-33; 36:35-38; 40:3,21; 2Ch 3:14; Isa 25:7 Mt 27:51 the Holiest. 8; 10:19; 1Ki 8:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-4","title":"Hebrews 9:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the golden. Le 16:12; 1Ki 7:50; Re 8:3 the ark. Ex 25:10-16; 26:33; 37:1-5; 39:35; 40:3,21 was. Ex 16:33,34 and Aaron's. Nu 17:5,8,10; Ps 110:2,3 and the. Ex 25:16,21; 26:33; 34:29; 40:3,20,21; De 10:2-5; 1Ki 8:9,21 2Ch 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-5","title":"Hebrews 9:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>over. Ex 25:17-22; 37:6-9; Le 16:2; Nu 7:89; 1Sa 4:4; 1Ki 8:6,7; 2Ki 19:15 Ps 80:1; 99:1; Eph 3:10; 1Pe 1:12 the mercy-seat. 4:16; Le 16:2,13; 1Ch 28:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-6","title":"Hebrews 9:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the priests. Ex 27:21; 30:7,8; Nu 28:3; 2Ch 26:16-19; Da 8:11; Lu 1:8-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-7","title":"Hebrews 9:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>into. 24,25; Ex 30:10; Le 16:2-20,34 not. 5:3; 7:27; 10:19,20 errors. Le 5:18; 2Sa 6:7; 2Ch 33:9; Ps 19:12; 95:10; Isa 3:12; 9:16; 28:7 Isa 29:14; Ho 4:12; Am 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-8","title":"Hebrews 9:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Holy Ghost. 3:7; 10:15; Isa 63:11; Ac 7:51,52; 28:25; Ga 3:8; 2Pe 1:21 the way. 3; 4:15,16; 10:19-22; Joh 10:7,9; 14:6; Eph 2:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-9","title":"Hebrews 9:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>a figure. 24; 11:19; Ro 5:14; 1Pe 3:21 the time. 7:11; 11:39,40; 1Pe 1:11,12 gifts. 5:1 that could. 13,14; 7:18,19; 10:1-4,11; Ps 40:6,7; Ga 3:21 as pertaining. Ps 51:16-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-10","title":"Hebrews 9:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>in meats. 13:9; Le 11:2-47; De 14:3-21; Eze 4:14; Ac 10:13-15; Col 2:16 divers. 6:2; *Gr: 10:22; Ex 29:4; 30:19-21; 40:12; Le 14:8,9; 16:4,24; 17:15,16; 22:6 Nu 19:7-21; De 21:6; 23:11 carnal. 1; 7:16; Ga 4:3,9; Eph 2:15; Col 2:20-22 ordinances. or, rites, or, ceremonies. until. 2:5; 6:5; Ga 4:4; Eph 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-11","title":"Hebrews 9:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Christ. Ge 49:10; Ps 40:7; Isa 59:20; Mal 3:1; Mt 2:6; 11:3; Joh 4:25 1Jo 4:2,3; 5:20; 2Jo 1:7 an high priest. 2:17; 3:1; 4:15; 5:5,6; 7:1,11-26,27; 8:1 of good. 10:1 by a greater. 1-9; 8:2; Joh 1:14; *Gr: not made. 23,24; Ac 7:48; 17:24,25; 2Co 5:1; Col 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-12","title":"Hebrews 9:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>by the. 13; 10:4; Le 8:2; 9:15; 16:5-10 by his. 1:3; 10:9-14; Ac 20:28; Eph 1:7; Col 1:14; Tit 2:14; 1Pe 1:18,19 Re 1:5; 5:9 he entered. 7,24-26; 10:12,19 once. 26,28; 10:10; Zec 3:9 having. 15; 5:9; Da 9:24; Mr 3:29; Ga 3:13,14; 1Th 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-13","title":"Hebrews 9:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>if. Le 16:14,16 and. Nu 19:2-21 the purifying. Nu 8:7; 19:12; 2Ch 30:19; Ps 51:7; Ac 15:9; 1Pe 1:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-14","title":"Hebrews 9:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>How. De 31:27; 2Sa 4:11; Job 15:16; Mt 7:11; Lu 12:24,28; Ro 11:12,24 the blood. 12; 1Pe 1:19; 1Jo 1:7; Re 1:5 who. Isa 42:1; 61:1; Mt 12:28; Lu 4:18; Joh 3:34; Ac 1:2; 10:38; Ro 1:4 1Pe 3:18 eternal. De 33:27; Isa 57:15; Jer 10:10; Ro 1:20; 1Ti 1:17 offered. 7; 7:27; Mt 20:28; Eph 2:5; 5:2; Tit 2:14; 1Pe 2:24; 3:18 without. Le 22:20; Nu 19:2-21; 28:3,9,11; De 15:21; 17:1; Isa 53:9 Da 9:24-26; 2Co 5:21; 1Pe 1:19; 2:22; 1Jo 3:5 spot. or, fault. purge. 9; 1:3; 10:2,22 dead works. 6:1 to serve. Lu 1:74; Ro 6:13,22; Ga 2:19; 1Th 1:9; 1Pe 4:2 the living. 11:21; De 5:26; 1Sa 17:26; 2Ki 19:16; Jer 10:10; Da 6:26; Ac 14:15 2Co 6:16; 1Ti 3:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-15","title":"Hebrews 9:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>the mediator. 7:22; 8:6; 12:24; 1Ti 2:5 the new. 8:8; 2Co 3:6 means. 16,28; 2:14; 13:20; Isa 53:10-12; Da 9:26 for. 12; 11:40; Ro 3:24-26;