ok":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Ex 29:12,20,36; Le 8:15,19; 9:8,9,18; 16:14-19; 2Ch 29:19-22 Eze 43:18-26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-22","title":"Hebrews 9:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>almost. Le 14:6,14,25,51,52 and without. Le 4:20,26,35; 5:10,12,18; 6:7; 17:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-23","title":"Hebrews 9:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>the patterns. 9,10,24; 8:5; 10:1; Col 2:17 the heavenly. 11,12,14,24; 10:4,10-17; Lu 24:26,46; Joh 14:3; 1Pe 1:19-21; Re 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-24","title":"Hebrews 9:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>the holy. 11; Mr 14:58; Joh 2:19-21 the figures. 9,23; 8:2 but. 1:3; 6:20; 7:26; 8:2,5; 12:2; Ps 68:18; Mr 16:19; Lu 24:51; Joh 6:62 Joh 16:28; Ac 1:9-11; 3:21; Eph 1:20-22; 4:8-11; Col 3:2; 1Pe 3:22 appear. 7:25; Ex 28:12,29; Zec 3:1; Ro 8:33; 1Jo 2:1,2; Re 8:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-25","title":"Hebrews 9:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>offer. 7,14,26; 10:10 as. 12; Ex 30:10; Le 16:2-34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-26","title":"Hebrews 9:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>the foundation. Mt 25:34; Joh 17:24; 1Pe 1:20; Re 13:8; 17:8 in. 1:2; Isa 2:2; Da 10:14; Mic 4:1; 1Co 10:11; Ga 4:1; Eph 1:10 1Pe 1:20 he appeared. 12; 7:27; 10:4,10; Le 16:21,22; 2Sa 12:13; 24:10; Job 7:21; Da 9:24 Joh 1:29; 1Pe 2:24; 3:18; 1Jo 3:5 the sacrifice. 14; 10:12,26; Eph 5:2; Tit 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-9-27","title":"Hebrews 9:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference"